# Claude Code writes a LOCAL settings file beside the tracked one. The
# tracked `.claude/settings.json` is this repo wiring `rekall hook` on
# itself (T72); the `.local.json` beside it is one machine's overrides and
# has no business following the repo to anyone else's checkout.
/.claude/settings.local.json

/target
/.direnv
# `nix build` drops this symlink into the store. Untracked by nature: it
# names a path that exists on one machine.
/result
/.rekall/fires
